  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\" id=\"isPasted\">• Brand introduction:<br>We are a premium mens collagen brand. Founded by two friends, one of which was suffering from chronic illaness &amp; a devastating autoimmune disease after years of being a combat sports athlete. Ilan was told he'd never walk again but with perseverance and the help of his friend Dave they researched the best supplements to aid in recovery. Collagen turned out to be the missing link to help alleviate a lot of his pain.<br id=\"isPasted\"><br>• Product description:<br>A premium collagen for men. Made in America in one of the best labs available. Unique amino acid profile which is very high in glycine, proline, and hydroxyproline making it a great collagen for men who are seeking functional recovery and support. Designed specifically for high bioavailability to make sure your bones, joints and connective tissue get the support they need.<br><br>• USP (Unique Selling Point):<br>We aren't a beauty based collagen. We are a mens focused, functional, premium collagen. Our product is kept to the highest standard and specifically formulated for men who are athletes, recovering from illness or injury or want to have the best chance at maintaining function as they age.<br><br>• Payment terms:<br><br>Lax payment options including zelle, paypal, venmo, cash app. check<br><br><br>• Other information:<br><br>We do our bagging in a veteran owned facility. We focus on men's mental health and believe that helping men maintain their identities and value by keeping them functional is paramount. We have been through the pain ourselves... this product helped us.</p></div></div>",
